\f0\fs24 \cf0 README_Fe_conc_pH_dependence\
\
Contains the raw kinetics data for three rounds of experiments testing the pH and Fe(II) concentration dependence\
\
ROUNDS 1-3: \
	A - pH 6\
	B - pH 7 \
	C - pH 8\
	D - pH 9\
	E - pH 10\
\
\
	Each letter in each round (1-3) contains four experiments; concentrations of Fe(II) are varied: (0.02, 0.05, 0.07, 0.2 mM). Concentration of CN is constant at 0.6 mM in all experiments. Note that the 0.1 mM Fe(II) + 0.6 mM CN experiments (raw data found in CN_conc_pH_dependence folder) are also plotted in the paper alongside this data. }